IMAGES
------
The evaluation images are not distributed in this repository. They come from
public Kaggle construction-safety datasets, Google Images and images generated
with Google Gemini, and remain subject to the terms of their original sources.

THIRD-PARTY MODELS
------------------
The inference code calls external models and tools (served via Ollama,
GroundingDINO, DETR via Hugging Face Transformers, OpenCLIP). These are not
included and remain subject to their own licenses.
